EastSun 20260929: "目前不是debug模式 但是你也要有按鈕可以給我直接關閉程式停止".
- tools/wb_serve.cpp: W906_ExternalQuitDue (EOF) -- named event Local\HT9045_wb_serve_quit_<pid>, checked once per main-loop
  pass next to W906_ServeQuitDue; set -> the loop leaves like the main Exit / --seconds (W906_ProdCloseSave +
  W906_ProdCloseShutdown, Program Close=1, server.Stop). op log STOP line.
- tools/stop_wb_serve.ps1: sets the event, waits 30 s for the exit, ends the process only if it did not end (a modal box
  holds the main loop). -FromStopButton leaves a wb_serve younger than 20 s alone (VS Code ends a noDebug session at once
  when the terminal has no shell integration).
- tasks.json: "IOWEB(這台): 關閉程式（正常關站）" and "IOWEB(這台): 停止鈕 -> 關閉程式"; launch.json: the latter is the
  postDebugTask of both no-debugger entries (ship and -O2).

